{"text":"# The approved data model: tables, columns and keys. Written by the factory from the approved plan; the built database is compared with it.\ntables:\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: EmployeeId\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: EmployeeName\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: CorporateEmail\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: Role\n        required: true\n        type: enum\n        values:\n          - employee\n          - administrator\n      - name: DedicatedParking\n        required: true\n        type: bool\n      - name: AssignedFloor\n        required: false\n        type: string\n      - name: AssignedSpace\n        required: false\n        type: string\n    name: Employee\n    purpose: Pre-provisioned Folio3 identities, roles, and dedicated parking\n      assignments.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: EmployeeId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: Employee\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Plate\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: Make\n        required: false\n        type: string\n      - name: Model\n        required: false\n        type: string\n      - name: Color\n        required: false\n        type: string\n      - name: Active\n        required: true\n        type: bool\n    name: Vehicle\n    purpose: Employee-owned registered vehicle plates and optional vehicle details.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: EmployeeId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: Employee\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: TokenHash\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: CreatedAt\n        required: true\n        type: datetime\n      - name: ExpiresAt\n        required: true\n        type: datetime\n    name: AuthSession\n    purpose: Hashed bearer-session credentials and their validity window.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: State\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: CreatedAt\n        required: true\n        type: datetime\n      - name: ExpiresAt\n        required: true\n        type: datetime\n    name: OAuthState\n    purpose: One-time OAuth state values and expiry used to validate sign-in callbacks.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: EmployeeId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: Employee\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: OfficeDate\n        required: true\n        type: date\n      - name: Space\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Status\n        required: true\n        type: enum\n        values:\n          - Reserved\n          - Released\n          - Claimed\n          - Cancelled\n      - name: ClaimableAt\n        required: true\n        type: datetime\n    name: ParkingRelease\n    purpose: Employee-owned dedicated-space releases for office dates.\n    uniques:\n      - - EmployeeId\n        - OfficeDate\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ParkingReleaseId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: ParkingRelease\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Action\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: OccurredAt\n        required: true\n        type: datetime\n    name: ReleaseAuditEvent\n    purpose: Append-only scheduling and state-transition history for a parking release.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Floor\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: TotalSpaces\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Enabled\n        required: true\n        type: bool\n    name: ParkingFloor\n    purpose: Enabled office parking floors and their total vehicle capacity.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: EmployeeId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: Employee\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: VehicleId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: Vehicle\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ParkingFloorId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: ParkingFloor\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: OfficeDate\n        required: true\n        type: date\n      - name: SpaceCode\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Status\n        required: true\n        type: enum\n        values:\n          - Active\n          - Cancelled\n      - name: EntryStatus\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    name: ParkingClaim\n    purpose: Employee temporary allocations linking an owned vehicle to a floor and\n      office date.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: RequestDetectionId\n        required: true\n        type: int\n        unique: true\n      - name: DetectedAt\n        required: true\n        type: datetime\n      - name: OfficeDate\n        required: true\n        type: date\n      - name: OfficeTime\n        required: true\n        type: time\n      - name: ObjectType\n        required: true\n        type: enum\n        values:\n          - car\n          - pedestrian\n          - motorcycle\n          - other\n      - name: Plate\n        required: false\n        type: string\n      - name: VerificationResult\n        required: false\n        type: enum\n        values:\n          - Authorized\n          - Denied\n          - Permanent sticker\n          - Unsuccessful\n          - Allocation cancelled\n      - name: EntryStatus\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: IndicatorCommand\n        required: true\n        type: enum\n        values:\n          - Green\n          - None\n      - name: Detail\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    name: EntranceCheck\n    purpose: Retained entrance detections and their fail-closed verification outcomes.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Timezone\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: ReleaseTime\n        required: true\n        type: time\n      - name: SchedulingWindowDays\n        required: true\n        type: int\n    name: OfficeSettings\n    purpose: Singleton office timezone, daily release time, and scheduling-window\n      settings.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: OfficeSettingsId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: OfficeSettings\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Email\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    name: OfficeReportRecipient\n    purpose: Email recipients configured for weekly utilization reports.\n    uniques:\n      - - OfficeSettingsId\n        - Email\n"}